# Desktop UI (macOS, Linux, Windows)

One UI in `lib/desktop/` for `macos/`, `linux/`, and `windows/`. Details: `apps/reader_flutter/lib/desktop/CLAUDE.md`.

## Rules

- Activate with `useDesktopShell(context)` from `lib/common/platform/platform_shell.dart`. It stays false when `kIsWeb` is true.
- Bodies are `DesktopXxxScreenBody` inside `DesktopPageScaffold` or `DesktopOverlayScaffold`. The body does not build the sidebar.
- Layout numbers live in `DesktopTokens`. Brand colors come from `AppColors` and `AppGradients`.
- Cover upload uses `FilePicker.platform.pickFiles`. `image_picker` has no Windows or Linux implementation.
- Import tokens, providers, and l10n from root `lib/`. Leave `lib/web/` and `lib/mobile/` unimported.
- Window icons, entitlements, CMake, and Inno Setup stay in the runner folders. Keep the `ethiopian_reader` binary name and the installer AppId.

```dart
if (useDesktopShell(context)) {
  return const DesktopPageScaffold(body: DesktopHomeScreenBody());
}
```

Run: `make reader-run-macos`, `make reader-run-linux`, `make reader-run-windows`. The Windows `.exe` is built in GitHub Actions.
